The circumference of the semicircle = \(\pi r + 2r = \pi \times 7.5 + 2 \times 7.5\).
Using \(\pi \approx 3.14\), we get:
Circumference = \(3.14 \times 7.5 + 2 \times 7.5 = 23.55 + 15 = 38.55\) cm.

